face runoff carefully directed onto the field. In the irrigated lands, rights concern not only the soil of the plot itself, but also stream water, channels, plantings (i.e. vines, qat or fruit trees) and ancillary structures (i.e. mud walls and guard room).\' '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2515, 'temperature': 0.2})
